96	     *
97	     * Running PHPStan in process is what gives peq the resolved types a dependency
98	     * graph needs, and this is the only place that does it: the container, the
99	     * analyser and the shape of its result are PHPStan's own vocabulary, and every
100	     * other part of peq works on the symbols this hands back.
101	     *
102	     * PHPStan parses a file in full only when its parser has been told the file is
103	     * one of those analysed; any other file is read with its function bodies
104	     * stripped, which is enough for reflection but leaves nothing for a collector
105	     * to see inside a function. PHPStan's own commands register the analysed files
106	     * with the parser before analysing, and so does this.
107	     *
108	     * A file PHPStan could not finish is reported as a failure rather than left out:
109	     * a graph that quietly lacks a file would claim that nothing depends on what
